"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/20","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/20","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/20/labels","id":10558797,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AoR1N","number":20,"title":"4.4","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":8,"closed_issues":4466,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-02-14T11:52:07Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T23:48:31Z","due_on":"2025-03-03T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-03-19T09:35:35Z"},"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-02-11T19:31:55Z","updated_at":"2025-02-12T10:24:23Z","closed_at":"2025-02-12T10:24:23Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nreproducible in v4.4.beta1.official [d33da79d3] through v4.4.beta3.official [06acfccf8]\nnot reproducible in v4.4.dev7.official [46c8f8c5c] and earlier\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.beta3 - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3050 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6636) - AMD Ryzen 5 5600G with Radeon Graphics (12 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen using the embed game option, touching the title bar of the window containing the game freezes the game and the editor for several seconds (usually just a couple but sometimes it's seemingly permanent)\n\nIf the floating workspace option is on, the freeze only happens when interacting with the game window's title bar.\n\nIf the floating workspace option is off and the game is embedded directly in the editor's window, the freeze happens when interacting with the editor's title bar.\n\nIf embedding is disabled altogether, the title bar is fine and can be interacted with without freezing anything.\n\nThe embedded toolbar (the bar under the title bar and above the game) can be interacted with just fine, the same with the game itself.\n\nThe resizing of the game's or the editor's window does not cause freezing. Though the game's viewport lags behind the window, which does not happen if embedding is disabled.\n\nThe title bar buttons (minimize, maximize, and close) are reacting to hover fine.\nClicking the minimize button seems to work every time without freezing.\nClicking the maximize button works sometimes, but sometimes can cause permanent freeze.\nClicking the close button works sometimes, but sometimes can cause permanent freeze.\n\nFreezing does not seem to increase CPU or memory usage.\n\nThis is also independent on the renderer: Forward+, Mobile, and Compatibility are all affected.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open any project in Godot 4.4 beta 3\n2. Make sure the \"embed game on next play\" is on\n3. Run the project\n4. Click or drag on the title bar of the window in which the game is embedded\n5. The windows freeze 😭\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A (happens in any project)","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102724/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengin